# Docker build context = the repository root. Keep it small, and above all keep secrets out of it:
# apps/api/.env is read by the API at startup (spring.config.import), so it must never end up in an image.
.git
.claude
docs
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/build
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
.DS_Store
